  "title": "Is tails due after five heads?",
  "logline": "Gus has seen five heads in a row and bets the farm on tails. Vera flips again.",
  "description": "A coin has no memory: after any streak, the next flip is still 50/50. Sources and simplifications in the pinned comment.",
